{"title": "Gargoyle Head", "pageid": 50595, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gargoyle_Head", "categories": ["Environmental objects", "Traps"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:TrapGargoyleHead.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/TrapGargoyleHead.png/200px-TrapGargoyleHead.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/TrapGargoyleHead.png/300px-TrapGargoyleHead.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/TrapGargoyleHead.png/400px-TrapGargoyleHead.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/TrapGargoyleHead.png/200px-TrapGargoyleHead.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/TrapGargoyleHead.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>A Gargoyle Head on a wall, hightlighted as a trap</figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <b>Gargoyle Head</b> is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Trap\" title=\"Trap\">Trap</a> that might be encountered in various places throughout all Acts of the game.\n</p><p>A Gargoyle Head is an interior feature, depicting a head of said creature chiselled of stone, placed onto a wall surface. It is a common adorning piece of various dungeons, crypts or well-equipped vaults, at the same time serving as a means of defence for these places (or parts of them) from unwanted trespassers.\n</p><p>As a trap, the Gargoyle Head usually is triggered through a marble plate (or any other similar means) planted nearby.\n</p><p>Upon triggering the Gargoyle Head sends forth <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Bolt\" title=\"Fire Bolt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/38px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/50px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Bolts\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Fire_Bolt_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Bolt\" title=\"Fire Bolt\">Fire Bolts</a> once per turn. The spell deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> on the impact with any obstacle on the firing line. The only exception are Gargoyle Heads in one of the halls of the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Vault\" title=\"Sorcerous Vault\">Sorcerous Vault</a>, shooting spells similar to <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Ice\" title=\"Arrow of Ice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Ice\" title=\"Arrow of Ice\">Arrows of Ice</a> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a>).\n</p><p>A Gargoyle Head can be disarmed with the help of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/25px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/38px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/50px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sleight of Hand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/25px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> skill, but the character must have a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit\" title=\"Trap Disarm Toolkit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit\" title=\"Trap Disarm Toolkit\">Trap Disarm Toolkit</a> in their inventory. Difficulty Class requirement is a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> roll.\n</p><p>After successful disarming, the Gargoyle Head crumbles down into a heap of stone rubble.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195648\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1838/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13034/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2818/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 968435/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.437      1 -total\n 48.83%   16.815      5 Template:Icon_text\n 48.40%   16.668     33 Template:Trim\n 41.62%   14.333      4 Template:Icon_link\n 40.05%   13.791      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 32.36%   11.145      2 Template:Item_icon\n 28.95%    9.970      1 Template:SAI\n 28.92%    9.960      9 Template:Ifempty\n 15.42%    5.310      2 Template:DamageText\n 12.25%    4.218      9 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:50595-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195648 and revision id 281358. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}